"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\"><div class=\"shell text-column regional-guide\"><h2>Perth Hills &amp; Swan Valley plumber and electrician FAQ</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Describe the property route and equipment location</h3><p>Include the complete address, the appropriate driveway or entry point and any known access restriction. If the equipment is outside or in a separate building, describe its location without entering a hazard. Tanks, pumps, private wastewater systems and other specialist infrastructure are not automatically included in a general repair request; confirm the specific task first.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Plumbing service scope</a></li><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Electrical repairs and installation scope</a></li><li><a href=\"service-areas.html\">Check the listed Perth service areas</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
